<title>USA: Fed says 14-day and fixed-system RPs added $11 bln.</title>
<headline>Fed says 14-day and fixed-system RPs added $11 bln.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-03-31</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Federal Reserve added a total of $6.992 billion and $4.589 billion in 14-day and overnight reserves, respectively, to the banking system Monday morning, a Fed spokeswoman said.</p>
<p>(( -- N.A. Treasury Desk 212-859-1660 ))</p>
